# Lost Days {4}{U} (CR 115.1, 701.24, 111.10f): the target may be an enchantment as well as a creature. Bot1 targets its own Rancor (an Aura, so an
# enchantment) and, as its owner, chooses the bottom of its library: Plains, Swamp, then Rancor below them. The Ornithopter Rancor enchanted stays.
# Lost Days is a spell, so the caster still gets the Clue. Lotus pays UUU, Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet the rest.

